{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"lemuroid-chalcedony-ibisbill","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context / Problem\n\nClosed epic `pink-complex-xenurine` and child `byzantine-spinelike-penguin` removed the severity configuration in commit `8db373933654c7c21fa214565426f562ca55cd80`. A post-epic census found no live parser/config field, but `docs/gerrit-aws-setup.md:383` still advertises a threshold and `src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:4,12` describes it as configurable.\n\n## Approach\n\nRemove only current operational claims, examples, and configuration descriptions of blocking-severity control. Preserve accurate historical ADR and archived-experiment references, and do not add a tombstone or revive a compatibility layer.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `docs/gerrit-aws-setup.md`\n- `src/rebar/review_bot/config.py`\n- maintained deployment/examples and focused documentation checks\n\n## Testing\n\nSearch maintained operational material for the removed configuration and run review-bot/documentation tests. Historical records are an explicit negative control.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] No live parser, config field, deployment example, or maintained operator guidance advertises `BLOCKING_SEVERITIES` or a blocking-severity threshold.\n- [ ] Historical ADRs and archived experiments retain accurate historical context and are not rewritten.\n- [ ] Four-pass Pass 3 remains the sole current voting-policy description.\n- [ ] Focused review-bot/documentation checks and a maintained-surface census pass.","id":"22ec-e638-c896-4b54","parent_id":"78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86","priority":2,"tags":["janitor","documentation","cleanup","rp28"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Remove residual blocking-severity guidance after completed severity retirement"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788313972460202001,"uuid":"912806c7-d2b6-4ec1-be4d-e2e8b63e4626"}